[225.741893, "o", "t match for searches.\r\n  -G  ........  --HILITE-SEARCH\r\n                  Don't highlight any matches for searches.\r\n  -h [\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m]  ....  --max-back-scroll=[\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m]\r\n                  Backward scroll limit.\r\n  -i  ........  --ignore-case\r\n                  Ignore case in searches that do not contain uppercase.\r\n  -I  ........  --IGNORE-CASE\r\n                  Ignore case in all searches.\r\n  -j [\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m]  ....  --jump-target=[\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m]\r\n                  Screen position of target lines.\r\n  -J  ........  --status-column\r\n                  Display a status column at left edge of screen.\r\n  -k [\u001b[4mfile\u001b[24m]  .  --lesskey-file=[\u001b[4mfile\u001b[24m]\r\n                  Use a lesskey file.\r\n  -K  ........  --quit-on-intr\r\n                  Exit less in response to ctrl-C.\r\n\u001b[7mHELP -- Press RETURN for more, or q when done\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[H\u001bM  ?\u001b[4mpattern\u001b[24m          *  Search backward for (\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m-th) matching line.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  /\u001b[4mpattern\u001b[24m          *  Search forward for (\u001b[4mN\u001b[24m-th) matching li"]
[225.741907, "o", "ne.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM                          \u001b[1mSEARCHING\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM        Default \"half-window\" is half of the screen height.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM        Default \"window\" is the screen height.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM        ---------------------------------------------------\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  R                    Repaint screen, discarding buffered input.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  r  ^R  ^L            Repaint screen.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  ESC-F                Like F but stop when search pattern is found.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  F                    Forward forever; like \"tail -f\".\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  ESC-{  ^LeftArrow    Left  to first column.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  ESC-}  ^RightArrow   Right to last column displayed.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  ESC-(  LeftArrow  *  Left  one half screen width (or \u001b[4mN\u001b[24m positions).\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM  ESC-)  RightArrow *  Right one half screen width (or \u001b[4mN\u001b[24m po"]
