[225.758854, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM      Notes in parentheses indicate the behavior if \u001b[4mN\u001b[24m is given.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM      Commands marked with * may be preceded by a number, \u001b[4mN\u001b[24m.\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM                   \u001b[1mSUMMARY\u001b[0m \u001b[1mOF\u001b[0m \u001b[1mLESS\u001b[0m \u001b[1mCOMMANDS\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[H\u001bM\r\n\u001b[40;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7mHELP -- Press RETURN for more, or q when done\u001b[27m\u001b[K\u0007\r\u001b[K\u001b[7mHELP -- Press RETURN for more, or q when done\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
